      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_INCOGNITA_FLOWER",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "다쳤잖아.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "怪我してる。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 128,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "괜찮아. 살짝 베인 것뿐이야.",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "大丈夫。少し切れただけだ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 129,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_INCOGNITA_FLOWER",
      "CameraOffset": "ONE_3",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "왜 자기가 다치면서까지…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "どうして自分が怪我をしてまで…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 130,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_INCOGNITA_FLOWER",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…아니. 그보다 여기까진 왜 쫓아온 거야?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "いや、それより…どうしてここまでついて来たんだ？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 131,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_INCOGNITA_FLOWER",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "뭐? 걱정돼서…?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "えっ？それは、心配で…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 132,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_INCOGNITA_FLOWER",
      "CameraOffset": "TWIN_6",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…하아. 도무지 이해할 수가 없네. 너란 사람은.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…はぁ。お前ってやつは、本当に理解に苦しむな。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 133,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_INCOGNITA_FLOWER",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "모질게 굴면 좀 떨어지란 말이야…",
